{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309879","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns TRUE if a specified database is multi-tenant enabled,\nand returns FALSE if it is not. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT-function__syntax_GC18S13601798\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d155343e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT-function__idGDM2JY2672029\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT( <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong><var class=\"keyword varname\">database-name</var><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong>)</code></pre>\n               \n                \n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">database-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A character expression that evaluates to a logical database\nname or database alias. If no database is specified and more than\none database is connected, the AVM raises an error. If the database\nname is not a valid name for a connected database, the AVM raises\nan error.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT-function__see-also_GC18S22695506\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d155343e144\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"IS-MULTI-TENANT-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IS-MULTI-TENANT-attribute.html\">IS-MULTI-TENANT attribute</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"IS-COLUMN-CODEPAGE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IS-COLUMN-CODEPAGE-function.html\">IS-COLUMN-CODEPAGE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"IS-LEAD-BYTE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IS-LEAD-BYTE-function.html\">IS-LEAD-BYTE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309879","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT-function.html","type":"Manual"}